# Build context of the analytics image (docker compose: build ./analytics).
# Allowlist: the dbt project, the quality checks and the runner. Tests, SQL scripts, the Superset image (its own
# context) and local dbt outputs stay out.
*
!requirements.txt
!run.sh
!dbt/
!quality/

# Inside the allowed directories: what a local "dbt build" or pytest leaves behind
dbt/target/
dbt/logs/
dbt/dbt_packages/
**/__pycache__
**/*.py[co]
**/.DS_Store
